<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle prices mostly steady-USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle prices mostly steady-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were mostly steady, instances $1.00 per cwt higher on calves under 500 lbs, compared to Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 82.00-87.00; 700-800 lbs 75.00-85.00; pkg 927 lbs 65.00. Holsteins - Large 2 20 head 383 lbs 75.00; 400-500 lbs 64.00-69.00; 500-600 lbs 60.00-66.50; 600-700 lbs 65.00-66.50; 700-800 lbs 59.75-63.50.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 71.50-74.50. Medium and Large 2 400-500 lbs 73.00-75.50.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
